Several key=value pairs in one call all land, and the summary lists them in order.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=ready-for-dev sp=5 "summary=short note"
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: draft
+status: ready-for-dev
+sp: 5
+summary: short note
 ---
 
 # Foo
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=ready-for-dev, sp=5, summary=short note
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: ready-for-dev
sp: 5
summary: short note
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
